{"id":50112,"date":"2026-03-25T13:57:20","date_gmt":"2026-03-25T12:57:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50112"},"modified":"2026-09-03T21:16:28","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T20:16:28","slug":"legua-diario-de-coimbra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/legua-diario-de-coimbra\/","title":{"rendered":"27\u00aa L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">27\u00aa L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>27\u00aa L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 uma das mais carism\u00e1ticas e tradicionais provas de atletismo urbano do pa\u00eds, celebrada no feriado nacional de <strong>5 de outubro<\/strong> no cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Numa organiza\u00e7\u00e3o conjunta do <strong>Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra<\/strong>, da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Coimbra<\/strong> e da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Coimbra (ADAC)<\/strong>, o evento convida atletas federados, populares e fam\u00edlias a percorrerem as art\u00e9rias monumentais da cidade universit\u00e1ria classificada como Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida oficial marcada para as <strong>09:30<\/strong> na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Rua da Sofia<\/strong> e chegada vibrante na <strong>Pra\u00e7a 8 de Maio<\/strong>, o tra\u00e7ado de <strong>1 L\u00e9gua (5.000 metros)<\/strong> desafia os participantes com passagens pela Avenida S\u00e1 da Bandeira, Coura\u00e7a dos Ap\u00f3stolos, Alta Universit\u00e1ria (Pra\u00e7a Dom Dinis) e pelas margens do Rio Mondego. Em simult\u00e2neo, a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> proporciona uma experi\u00eancia de conv\u00edvio acess\u00edvel a todas as idades, com cronometragem de alta precis\u00e3o da Lap2Go, abastecimentos e entrega de kit de atleta com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial e medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transfor