d\udcc5 5 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 4.96 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Encerrada)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Atual (com T-Shirt):<\/strong> 8.96 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada da L\u00e9gua<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:31<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 4.96 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Encerrada)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Atual:<\/strong> 6.96 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a nova data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da 27\u00aa L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ap\u00f3s reagendamento oficial da data inicial de julho, a prova realiza-se na segunda-feira, 5 de outubro de 2026 (feriado da Implanta\u00e7\u00e3o da Rep\u00fablica), com partida \u00e0s 09:30 para a corrida de 1 L\u00e9gua e \u00e0s 09:31 para a caminhada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde est\u00e3o localizadas a partida e a chegada do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida realiza-se na Rua da Sofia e a meta final est\u00e1 instalada na Pra\u00e7a 8 de Maio, em pleno centro hist\u00f3rico de Coimbra.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra a Corrida de 1 L\u00e9gua (5.000 metros \/ 5 km) cronometrada com chip para atletas de v\u00e1rios escal\u00f5es (juvenis a veteranos) e a Caminhada de 5 km sem cariz competitivo, aberta a participantes de todas as faixas et\u00e1rias.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o valor das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e onde podem ser efetuadas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem online na plataforma oficial Lap2Go at\u00e9 30 de setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 23:59. O valor atual \u00e9 de 8,96 \u20ac na Corrida (com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica) e 6,96 \u20ac na Caminhada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Por onde passa o tra\u00e7ado da prova na cidade de Coimbra?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso de 5 km passa por locais hist\u00f3ricos emblem\u00e1ticos como a Rua da Sofia, Avenida S\u00e1 da Bandeira, Rua Padre Ant\u00f3nio Vieira, Coura\u00e7a dos Ap\u00f3stolos, Alta Universit\u00e1ria (Pra\u00e7a Dom Dinis), Ladeira do Semin\u00e1rio, Avenida Em\u00eddio Navarro e Pra\u00e7a 8 de Maio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"27\u00aa L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Rua da Sofia (Partida) \/ Pra\u00e7a 8 de Maio (Meta), Coimbra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra, C\u00e2mara Municipal de Coimbra e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Coimbra\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a nova data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da 27\u00aa L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ap\u00f3s reagendamento oficial da data inicial de julho, a prova realiza-se na segunda-feira, 5 de outubro de 2026 (feriado da Implanta\u00e7\u00e3o da Rep\u00fablica), com partida \u00e0s 09:30 para a corrida de 1 L\u00e9gua e \u00e0s 09:31 para a caminhada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde est\u00e3o localizadas a partida e a chegada do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida realiza-se na Rua da Sofia e a meta final est\u00e1 instalada na Pra\u00e7a 8 de Maio, em pleno centro hist\u00f3rico de Coimbra.\"}}, {\"@ty